<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Sol Petroleo Q1 net $90,387.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Sol Petroleo Q1 net $90,387.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three mths ended Sept 30.</p>
<p>Net $90,387 vs n/a.</p>
<p>Note: The oil company had no extraordinary result. Comparative figures were unavailable. Full name is Sol Petroleo SA. Net assets were $84.4 million.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 3180668</p>
</text>
